{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"note on ranged attacks:\nSome Ranged Attacks, such as those made with a Longbow or a Shortbow, have two ranges. The smaller number is the normal range, and the larger number is the long range. Your Attack roll has disadvantage when your target is beyond normal range, and you can't Attack a target beyond the long range.","created_at":"2020-10-30T05:18:11.723000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"771603842352545802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
